	(text "Arduino Mega 2560 headers, positions as in KiCad's Arduino_Mega shield template.\nD0/D1 stay free for the USB serial port. D20/D21 (I2C, J6) go to the INA226.\nSDA/SCL on J2 and 5V on J1 are the same signals as on J6/J7 (joined on the Mega): unused.\nD13 drives the on-board LED and blinks in the bootloader: only the push button is there."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 205.74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4b2b5120-7866-5da0-8429-c34e3f4e855f")
	)
